> much can it hurt me to kill more?  I'm currently piously aligned, and

Guards cost your telepathy for one or more so take out the
rest.  I think guards cost a point of luck each for lawfuls but
I never checked for neutrals.  I suggest hunting some floating
eyes with your tinning kit, taking out the guards, then doing
altar camping to restore your luck.  You'll want to kill a flock
of hostiles and wait maybe 1000 turns after killing the last
guard before altar camping to cover your numerical alignment.
It won't be pious after taking them out so explore and kill for
a bit until you think it is.  If you have a means of checking
your alignment, use it about every 500 turns and/or few dozen
hostiles until it's safe to pray.  Them make holy water and
proceed with your altar dancing.

