With the Orb of Weight blessed your luck will drift towards
positive one point every (is it 500 turns?).  Mark down the turn
when you start, how many you took out in total, then you'll
know your luck.  It isn't necessary to pray with 0+ luck if you
know your numerical alignment is positive or vice versa.  Those
are the costs.

